<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
  <title>Permintaan Maaf Resmi Buat Sayang — Kasus Menggabut vs Mengebut</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com/3.4.17"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.9.3/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            oat: '#FBF8F3',
            linen: '#F3ECE1',
            sand: '#E6DEC8',
            espresso: '#2C2520',
            cocoa: '#6E6259',
            terracotta: '#C8765A',
            terracottaDark: '#B06045',
            terracottaLight: '#F6E7E1',
            sage: '#6E8B7B',
            sageLight: '#E7EFEA',
            butter: '#E8C574',
            butterLight: '#FAF1D8',
            blush: '#DF9A8C'
          },
          fontFamily: {
            serif: ['"Fraunces"', 'Georgia', 'serif'],
            sans: ['"Plus Jakarta Sans"', '"Inter"', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['"JetBrains Mono"', 'monospace']
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>
  <style>
    * {
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #FBF8F3;
      color: #2C2520;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Inter', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#E6DEC8 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 22px 22px;
    }
    /* Paper texture card style */
    .paper-card {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1.5px solid #E2D9C5;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -6px rgba(44, 37, 32, 0.07), 0 4px 0px #E2D9C5;
    }
    .paper-card-soft {
      background-color: #FBF8F3;
      border: 1.5px solid #E2D9C5;
    }
    .tactile-btn {
      transition: transform 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.15s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0px #8F4A32;
    }
    .tactile-btn:active {
      transform: translateY(3px);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 0px #8F4A32;
    }
    .tactile-btn-secondary {
      transition: transform 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.15s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 0px #D5CBB4;
    }
    .tactile-btn-secondary:active {
      transform: translateY(2px);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 0px #D5CBB4;
    }
    /* Step transitions */
    .step-section {
      display: none;
      animation: stepEnter 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) forwards;
    }
    .step-section.active {
      display: block;
    }
    @keyframes stepEnter {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.98);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }
    }
    @keyframes floatSlow {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(1.5deg); }
    }
    @keyframes waveFlag {
      0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-6deg); }
      50% { transform: rotate(8deg); }
    }
    @keyframes scooterBounce {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    }
    @keyframes speedLines {
      0% { transform: translateX(12px); opacity: 0; }
      50% { opacity: 1; }
      100% { transform: translateX(-18px); opacity: 0; }
    }
    @keyframes shakeCard {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
      20% { transform: translateX(-6px) rotate(-1deg); }
      40% { transform: translateX(6px) rotate(1deg); }
      60% { transform: translateX(-4px); }
      80% { transform: translateX(4px); }
    }
    @keyframes popIn {
      0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8) translateY(10px); }
      70% { transform: scale(1.03) translateY(-2px); }
      100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
    }
    @keyframes pulseSoft {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.04); }
    }
    .animate-float {
      animation: floatSlow 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .animate-flag {
      transform-origin: bottom left;
      animation: waveFlag 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .animate-scooter {
      animation: scooterBounce 0.35s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .animate-speed {
      animation: speedLines 0.6s linear infinite;
    }
    .animate-pop {
      animation: popIn 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
    }
    .animate-pulse-soft {
      animation: pulseSoft 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .shake-trigger {
      animation: shakeCard 0.38s ease-in-out;
    }
    /* Custom floating text particle */
    .floating-word {
      position: absolute;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: floatUpFade 0.95s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
      z-index: 30;
    }
    @keyframes floatUpFade {
      0% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(0.85); }
      100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-48px) scale(1.05); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-terracottaLight selection:text-espresso">

  <!-- Top Sticky Mobile Header & Progress -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-oat/95 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-sand px-4 py-3">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-terracottaLight text-terracotta font-serif font-semibold text-sm border border-terracotta/30" id="stepBadge">1</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-cocoa leading-none" id="stepLabel">Bab 1 dari 5</p>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-espresso mt-0.5" id="stepTitleTop">Bendera Putih Darurat</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Progress Dots -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5" aria-label="Progress Alur">
        <button type="button" id="navDot1" class="w-5 h-2 rounded-full bg-terracotta transition-all duration-300" title="Bab 1"></button>
        <button type="button" id="navDot2" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sand transition-all duration-300" title="Bab 2"></button>
        <button type="button" id="navDot3" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sand transition-all duration-300" title="Bab 3"></button>
        <button type="button" id="navDot4" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sand transition-all duration-300" title="Bab 4"></button>
        <button type="button" id="navDot5" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sand transition-all duration-300" title="Bab 5"></button>
      </div>

      <!-- Sound Toggle -->
      <button type="button" id="soundToggleBtn" class="flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-linen border border-sand text-xs font-medium text-espresso hover:bg-sand/50 transition" aria-label="Toggle Suara Efek">
        <span id="soundIcon">🔊</span>
        <span id="soundText" class="text-[11px]">Suara</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Mobile Container -->
  <main class="flex-1 w-full max-w-md mx-auto px-4 py-5 flex flex-col justify-center">

    <!-- ==========================================
         BAB 1: BENDERA PUTIH & DETEKTOR NGAMBEK
    =========================================== -->
    <section id="step1" class="step-section active">
      <div class="paper-card rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Stamp Badge -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-butterLight border border-butter text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-espresso">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-terracotta animate-ping"></span>
            SURAT DARURAT BUAT SAYANG
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cocoa">No. 01/MGB-MGBT</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Animated Cute Bear Holding White Flag SVG -->
        <div class="my-3 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-linen/70 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-sand relative">
          <svg class="w-40 h-36 animate-float" viewBox="0 0 200 170" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <!-- Soft Shadow -->
            <ellipse cx="100" cy="155" rx="52" ry="8" fill="#E2D9C5"/>
            <!-- White Flag Pole & Waving Flag -->
            <g class="animate-flag" style="transform-origin: 142px 115px;">
              <line x1="142" y1="120" x2="152" y2="28" stroke="#6E6259" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M152 30 C168 26, 178 38, 192 33 L188 64 C174 68, 165 56, 149 62 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <text x="157" y="50" fill="#C8765A" font-size="9" font-family="Plus Jakarta Sans" font-weight="700">DAMAI</text>
            </g>
            <!-- Cute Character Ears -->
            <circle cx="68" cy="52" r="16" fill="#D7B399" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="68" cy="52" r="8" fill="#DF9A8C"/>
            <circle cx="126" cy="52" r="16" fill="#D7B399" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="126" cy="52" r="8" fill="#DF9A8C"/>
            <!-- Body -->
            <path d="M62 115 C62 94, 132 94, 132 115 L136 148 C136 152, 58 152, 58 148 Z" fill="#C8765A" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="3"/>
            <!-- Scarf -->
            <path d="M68 106 Q97 118 126 106 L122 120 Q97 128 72 120 Z" fill="#FAF1D8" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <!-- Head -->
            <rect x="56" y="48" width="82" height="64" rx="32" fill="#E5C5AC" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="3"/>
            <!-- Blush cheeks -->
            <ellipse cx="72" cy="86" rx="7" ry="4.5" fill="#DF9A8C"/>
            <ellipse cx="122" cy="86" rx="7" ry="4.5" fill="#DF9A8C"/>
            <!-- Pleasing Puppy Eyes -->
            <circle cx="80" cy="76" r="5.5" fill="#2C2520"/>
            <circle cx="78" cy="74" r="2" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
            <circle cx="114" cy="76" r="5.5" fill="#2C2520"/>
            <circle cx="112" cy="74" r="2" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
            <!-- Worried cute eyebrows -->
            <path d="M72 66 Q80 63 85 67" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M122 66 Q114 63 109 67" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <!-- Snout & pleading mouth -->
            <ellipse cx="97" cy="84" rx="11" ry="8" fill="#FBF8F3" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <ellipse cx="97" cy="81" rx="4" ry="2.8" fill="#2C2520"/>
            <path d="M93 87 Q97 84 101 87" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <!-- Sweat drop -->
            <path d="M133 58 C133 58, 138 65, 138 68 C138 71, 135.5 73, 133 73 C130.5 73, 128 71, 128 68 C128 65, 133 58, 133 58 Z" fill="#98C1D9" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2"/>
            <!-- Hands holding flag & heart -->
            <circle cx="64" cy="126" r="9" fill="#E5C5AC" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <circle cx="140" cy="118" r="9" fill="#E5C5AC" stroke="#2C2520" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-cocoa italic">
            "Permisi Sayang... aku bawa bendera putih nih 🏳️"
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-[26px] font-semibold text-espresso leading-snug text-center">
          Halo Sayangku, jangan di-close dulu yaa..
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm text-cocoa leading-relaxed text-center">
          Aku tahu sekarang kamu kemungkinan lagi sebel—tapi sebel yang <span class="font-semibold text-espresso underline decoration-terracotta decoration-wavy underline-offset-4">marahnya lucu banget</span> gara-gara aku ledekin barusan.
        </p>

        <!-- Interactive Mood Check -->
        <div class="mt-5 paper-card-soft rounded-2xl p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <label for="moodRange" class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-espresso">
              Cek Suhu Ngambek Kamu Sekarang:
            </label>
            <span id="moodBadge" class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-terracottaLight text-terracotta">
              Level 3: Ngambek Gemes 😤🤏
            </span>
          </div>
          <input
            id="moodRange"
            type="range"
            min="1"
            max="4"
            value="3"
            class="w-full accent-terracotta cursor-pointer h-2 bg-sand rounded-lg"
          />
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] text-cocoa font-mono mt-1">
            <span>1. Biasa</span>
            <span>2. Cemberut</span>
            <span>3. Ngambek Lucu</span>
            <span>4. Mode Singa!</span>
          </div>
          <p id="moodResponseText" class="mt-2.5 text-xs text-espresso bg-white/80 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-sand/80 leading-relaxed">
            💬 <em>"Iya kelihatan dari jauh pipinya agak gembung dikit karena sebel aku ledekin..."</em>
          </p>
        </div>

        <button
          type="button"
          id="toStep2Btn"
          class="tactile-btn mt-5 w-full py-3.5 px-5 rounded-2xl bg-terracotta hover:bg-terracottaDark text-white font-semibold text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>Buka Berkas Perkara</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         BAB 2: REKONSTRUKSI TKP (CHAT & BEDAH KATA)
    =========================================== -->
    <section id="step2" class="step-section">
      <div class="paper-card rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-sageLight border border-sage/40 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-espresso">
            🔍 REKONSTRUKSI TKP CHAT
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cocoa">Bukti #02</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-espresso leading-snug">
          Tragedi Satu Huruf: <span class="text-terracotta">Menggabut</span> vs <span class="text-sage">Mengebut</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-cocoa leading-relaxed">
          Mari kita putar ulang kejadian kenapa aku sampai khilaf ngeledekin kamu:
        </p>

        <!-- Simulated Mobile Chat Window -->
        <div class="mt-4 bg-linen rounded-2xl p-3.5 border border-sand space-y-3" id="chatContainer">
          <!-- Chat Header -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 border-b border-sand/80">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-terracottaLight border border-terracotta/40 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
                🤍
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-espresso leading-none">Sayangku ✨</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-sage font-medium mt-0.5">● Online (Sambil pegang HP)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button
              type="button"
              id="replayChatBtn"
              class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-sand text-espresso hover:bg-oat transition"
            >
              ↻ Putar Ulang
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Message 1: Aku -->
          <div id="chatMsg1" class="flex flex-col items-end">
            <div class="max-w-[82%] bg-espresso text-oat rounded-2xl rounded-tr-sm px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-sm">
              <p>Sayang, aku lagi <span class="underline decoration-butter font-semibold">menggabut</span> nih...</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cocoa mt-1">Maksud aku: Lagi santai / gabut 🛋️</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Brain Optical Illusion Box -->
          <div id="chatIllusion" class="bg-butterLight/90 border border-butter rounded-xl p-2.5 text-center my-1">
            <p class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-cocoa">✨ Yang Terbaca Oleh Mata Sayang ✨</p>
            <div class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold">
              <span id="wordMorphLeft" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white border border-sand text-cocoa line-through">menggabut</span>
              <span>➔</span>
              <span id="wordMorphRight" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-terracotta text-white animate-pulse-soft">mengebut 🛵💨</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Message 2: Sayang -->
          <div id="chatMsg2" class="flex flex-col items-start">
            <div class="max-w-[88%] bg-white border-2 border-terracotta rounded-2xl rounded-tl-sm px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-sm relative">
              <span class="absolute -top-2.5 right-2 bg-terracotta text-white text-[9px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">
                CHAT PALING LUCU!
              </span>
              <p class="font-bold text-espresso text-sm sm:text-base mt-0.5">
                "janan mengebutt dong sayang"
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-terracotta font-medium mt-1">
              Ada typo "janan" + "mengebutt" double T karena panik khawatir 🥺
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Message 3: Aku (The Mistake) -->
          <div id="chatMsg3" class="flex flex-col items-end">
            <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-terracottaLight border border-terracotta/40 text-espresso rounded-2xl rounded-tr-sm px-3.5 py-2 text-xs">
              <p class="italic text-cocoa">
                *Aku malah ketawa & ngeledekin gara-gara kamu salah baca menggabut jadi mengebut...* 🤦‍♂️
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cocoa mt-1">Status sekarang: Kena marah lucu 😾</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Interactive Toggle: Bedah Makna -->
        <div class="mt-4 paper-card-soft rounded-2xl p-3.5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-espresso mb-2 text-center">
            Klik buat bandingin yang ada di pikiran kita:
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
            <button
              type="button"
              id="tabMenggabutBtn"
              class="py-2 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold border transition bg-espresso text-white border-espresso"
            >
              🛋️ Menggabut (Aku)
            </button>
            <button
              type="button"
              id="tabMengebutBtn"
              class="py-2 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold border transition bg-white text-espresso border-sand"
            >
              🛵 Mengebut (Kamu)
            </button>
          </div>
          <div id="meaningBox" class="mt-2.5 bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-sand text-xs text-espresso leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Meng-ga-but (Kata Kerja Santai):</strong> Rebahan tak berdaya, bengong nungguin chat dari kamu, kecepatan 0 km/jam di kasur.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation Buttons -->
        <div class="mt-5 flex gap-2.5">
          <button
            type="button"
            id="backToStep1Btn"
            class="tactile-btn-secondary px-
